%% Supabase schema design — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid.

flowchart TD
    need([A feature needs to store something]) --> reuse{Can an existing table<br/>or column carry it?}
    reuse -->|yes| use[Use it; note the choice<br/>in the change log]
    reuse -->|no| shape{One value per row,<br/>or a list?}
    shape -->|value| col[New column]
    shape -->|list| tbl[New table with owner column]
    col --> rls[RLS + grants + index + on delete]
    tbl --> rls
    rls --> record[Change-log row + ERD edit]
    record --> drizzle[Drizzle schema → generated migration]
    use --> drizzle
    drizzle --> gate[Apply to dev; grants and RLS gate]
    gate --> commit([One commit: migration + SCHEMA.md])
